data: {"id": "7be5abf8d97e4551-thinking-parallel_evidence-2333", "run_id": "7be5abf8d97e4551", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "# 证据分析\n\n## 已采集事实\n\n### 1. Pod 状态 (Metrics + Describe + YAML)\n- **Pod UID**: `b134b5a8-7471-4feb-a975-9fbb0cc4f912`\n- **Phase**: Pending\n- **Container status**: `app` container, `ready=false`, `reason=ContainerCreating`, `restarts=0`\n- **Metrics 确认**: `kube_pod_container_status_waiting_reason{reason=\"ContainerCreating\"}` = 1, `kube_pod_status_phase{phase=\"Pending\"}` = 1\n\n### 2. Events 关键发现\n- **事件原文**: `Pod workload-5dbb5dcd6c-nhd7v in namespace aiops-case-05 failed to create sandbox due to missing", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 2, "ts_ms": 1788433286045, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

