*影响机制**：Multus CNI 在尝试为 Pod 配置网络时，试图引用该 NAD 资源，但查询失败（`not found`）。这导致网络初始化流程阻断，进而使得 kubelet 无法创建 Pod 的 Sandbox。\n- **证据支持**：\n  - 持续触发的 `NoNetworkFound` 警告事件（如事实 #2），明确指出 `network-attachment-definitions.k8s.cni.cncf.io \"unavailable-network\" not found`。\n  - `FailedCreatePodSandBox` 错误事件（事实 #3），确认了网络插件失败是导致沙箱创建异常的根因。\n  - 容器状态显示原因为 `ContainerCreating`（事实 #1），排除了应用启动失败的可能性，定位为基础设施配置缺失。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 1.6m\n├─ 问题定位: 33.8s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 48.1s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-05/workload-5dbb5dcd6c-nhd7v: 48.1s (Evidence 41.8s, RCA 6.2s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 11.5s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-05/workload-5dbb5dcd6c-nhd7v**: pod-imagepull-failed, pod-volume-mount-failed\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 93.405, "metrics": {"run_id": "7be5abf8d97e4551", "mttr": {"value": "1.6m", "seconds": 93.40766954421997, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "45%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-imagepull-failed, pod-volume-mount-failed", "pass": true, "score": 0.85, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.09}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.06}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.2, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "完整因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 0.8, "weighted_score": 0.12, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "det